@title Live current paths: thin dashes on the wires that carry a load current
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Shift+L opens the live view. On the control page, holding the start button
# closes the contactor circuit; the wires on the route to the coil get thin
# dashes. At rest there are none. The card has a Current paths switch.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key shift+l
wait 20
tree Go
try click_text "Go to page 2 Control circuit"
wait 20
shot at-rest
expect_not "Current paths"
